<title>JAPAN: Japan Feb large store sales down 1.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Feb large store sales down 1.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at Japanese department stores and supermarkets fell 1.9 percent in February from a year earlier to 1.61 trillion yen, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The breakdown for the figures is as follows:</p>
<p>				  FEB	 JAN	DEC</p>
<p>    Overall change	 -1.9	-0.6     -2.1</p>
<p>	Dept stores	  -0.1	+0.3     -1.0</p>
<p>	Supermarkets	 -3.5	-1.3     -3.2</p>
</text>
